WEBVTT

02:05.166 --> 02:06.000
Hey.

02:09.212 --> 02:10.046
Fuck.

03:07.395 --> 03:09.314
One, two, three.

03:09.397 --> 03:11.191
She'll take care of the security cameras.

03:12.358 --> 03:15.528
Just make sure that the scene is clean.
Especially his phone.

03:22.118 --> 03:23.328
SLIDE TO POWER OFF

03:30.251 --> 03:33.963
OUT OF BUSINESS
DO NOT ENTER

03:34.047 --> 03:38.176
YEONGSAN FUNERAL HOME

04:11.000 --> 04:12.001
It's me.

04:13.294 --> 04:14.629
He scratched me on the foot.

04:15.213 --> 04:17.674
Don't worry. I'm taking care of it.

04:19.384 --> 04:20.593
What's your plan?

04:21.094 --> 04:24.222
I'm going to bury him.
That's the best way to do it.

04:24.722 --> 04:25.890
I'll keep in touch.

04:31.396 --> 04:33.982
The sun will be coming up soon.
Should we bury him?

04:34.065 --> 04:35.400
We can't do it today anyway.

04:36.526 --> 04:39.195
We'll do it when it rains
so the evidence gets tainted.

04:43.741 --> 04:44.742
Hey.

04:47.704 --> 04:48.871
Stop for a second.

05:03.177 --> 05:05.263
MORTUARY

05:13.646 --> 05:16.065
Are you awake, Ms. Park?

05:27.535 --> 05:31.039
It looks like you had a bad dream.
You can lie down for a bit longer.

05:31.122 --> 05:34.167
Who are you? What did you do to me?

05:34.250 --> 05:36.336
Camera. Where is the security camera?

05:37.337 --> 05:39.005
-Oh, are you all right?
-Let go!

05:39.088 --> 05:42.175
Show me the camera!
What did you do to me while I was asleep?

05:42.258 --> 05:43.426
What did you do?

05:44.886 --> 05:47.930
The Privacy Act forbids any cameras
in the procedure room!

05:48.014 --> 05:51.017
The anesthesia hasn't worn off yet,
so you must be a bit confused.

05:51.100 --> 05:53.811
Could you tell me
how you're feeling at the moment?

05:54.979 --> 05:57.398
But her blood pressure
and pulse were all normal.

05:57.482 --> 06:00.068
Ms. Park! You shouldn't be driving yet!

06:42.819 --> 06:44.987
I had so many questions…

06:47.073 --> 06:48.491
but they're pointless now.

06:50.243 --> 06:51.828
Does it still hurt?

06:53.413 --> 06:54.747
I don't want to hear that.

06:56.582 --> 06:58.418
A casual question like that.

06:59.460 --> 07:03.714
Even if it's all become pointless,
there's a question that you should ask me.

07:05.258 --> 07:06.759
"Did Yeon-jin do it?"

07:13.808 --> 07:17.061
Did you look for Son Myeong-o?
I even sent you a picture.

07:21.816 --> 07:23.526
Is there anything else I should know?

07:24.110 --> 07:27.405
I think you know enough to leave Yeon-jin.

07:29.407 --> 07:30.324
You see,

07:30.825 --> 07:34.871
I don't want anybody
to stay by Yeon-jin's side.

07:34.954 --> 07:36.038
Especially her husband.

07:37.540 --> 07:38.374
Why is that?

07:39.375 --> 07:41.794
Because I think
you're Yeon-jin's glory, Mr. Ha.

07:43.463 --> 07:44.881
And I want you

07:45.631 --> 07:48.134
to become Yeon-jin's ruin instead.

07:52.430 --> 07:54.140
For someone with a plan like that,

07:55.224 --> 07:57.226
you weren't very proactive.

07:58.811 --> 08:00.480
Not as aggressive as I imagined.

08:07.778 --> 08:09.530
I'm not going to leave Yeon-jin.

08:12.992 --> 08:13.826
Why?

08:15.077 --> 08:16.078
I don't know.

08:17.747 --> 08:19.665
I hate saying I don't know something,

08:20.500 --> 08:21.667
but I don't know yet.

08:25.129 --> 08:28.216
I've only just realized
that I'm not going to leave Yeon-jin.

08:32.053 --> 08:33.054
So…

08:37.016 --> 08:38.017
let's meet again.

09:01.123 --> 09:03.125
You can keep sleeping. 20 more minutes?

09:08.756 --> 09:11.676
I haven't had dinner yet.
I'll wake you up when I'm done.

09:12.552 --> 09:15.721
I'm awake now
because the food smells so good.

09:17.682 --> 09:19.016
Do you have enough for me?

09:19.517 --> 09:20.685
It's amazing, right?

09:20.768 --> 09:23.271
Right, Park Yeon-jin came in
and had the procedure.

09:23.354 --> 09:25.314
And I met with Ha Do-yeong.

09:26.482 --> 09:27.400
Let me help.

09:27.483 --> 09:30.570
I'm a bad cook, but a good assistant.

09:41.247 --> 09:42.123
It's hot.

09:42.707 --> 09:44.000
You'll get hurt.

09:46.419 --> 09:50.047
It seems like others have a harder time
looking at my scars than I do.

09:51.507 --> 09:52.675
It's not like that.

09:53.467 --> 09:55.886
"Why did you dress so nicely
to go and see Ha?"

09:55.970 --> 09:58.097
"You could have just gone in your sweats."

09:58.180 --> 09:59.807
That's what my face is saying.

10:02.101 --> 10:03.519
I just ended up being cold.

10:05.438 --> 10:08.774
Call me when you're done.
I haven't even washed my face yet.

10:11.152 --> 10:12.320
Let me treat you.

10:18.743 --> 10:21.162
Starting from the wounds
closest to your wrists

10:21.871 --> 10:24.040
and the ones closest to your ankles.

10:26.000 --> 10:27.084
It's meaningless.

10:27.168 --> 10:28.586
It's not meaningless.

10:30.046 --> 10:33.549
A wound can be healed
by creating an even deeper wound.

10:34.216 --> 10:35.968
So it can fill up with new skin.

10:36.552 --> 10:38.554
Let me be the one to make those wounds.

10:40.389 --> 10:42.391
It won't look like before,

10:43.017 --> 10:44.268
but it will be close.

10:48.147 --> 10:51.567
It's meaningless
because the scars don't bother me.

11:06.749 --> 11:09.585
Sun-a did a good job
with the interview at the embassy.

11:09.669 --> 11:11.003
You can now make the payment

11:11.087 --> 11:14.256
and buy a plane ticket for the day
that she's supposed to leave.

11:15.174 --> 11:18.177
Thank you.
Please text me your bank account number.

11:35.361 --> 11:36.862
Who can make the prettiest V?

11:36.946 --> 11:38.531
So pretty!

11:39.031 --> 11:41.951
-Let's go to the jungle gym now.
-Yay!

11:43.119 --> 11:45.454
Okay, be careful. Careful.

11:46.706 --> 11:47.790
Careful.

11:58.259 --> 12:00.720
RED APPLE - GREEN APPLE

12:19.447 --> 12:20.698
I have a package for you.

12:21.824 --> 12:23.492
-A package?
-Yes.

12:26.370 --> 12:28.456
Oh, but I'm not waiting for any packages.

12:31.208 --> 12:32.793
Hope you feel better.

12:33.794 --> 12:35.588
It's from Dong-eun.

12:56.108 --> 12:58.611
They picked a host family
for Sun-a's homestay.

12:58.694 --> 13:01.280
If you'd like to say anything,
write it down.

13:01.363 --> 13:04.033
I'll translate it and send it to them.

13:04.116 --> 13:06.744
"Laura Willson."

13:08.954 --> 13:12.792
I'm sending the lipstick
because I think it'll look good on you.

13:20.382 --> 13:23.636
From now on,
I'll contact you through Sun-a's phone.

13:30.559 --> 13:34.230
Mother came back from praying
at Gyeryongsan. She prayed over this food.

13:34.313 --> 13:37.566
Oh dear. You shouldn't have!

13:38.067 --> 13:39.568
I'll enjoy every bit of it.

13:41.529 --> 13:43.405
JOO GENERAL HOSPITAL EMPLOYEE

13:43.989 --> 13:44.824
One second.

13:48.410 --> 13:49.411
Hello?

13:49.495 --> 13:50.996
SEOUL JOO GENERAL HOSPITAL

13:51.080 --> 13:52.373
What are you talking about?

13:52.456 --> 13:55.376
Why is the director's son
suddenly looking for So-hee's body?

13:56.001 --> 13:57.002
Beats me.

13:57.503 --> 13:59.505
Maybe he wants to inherit the hospital.

14:01.173 --> 14:03.092
But you know what's even weirder?

14:03.175 --> 14:06.262
That body isn't in the mortuary.
It's in the freezer.

14:06.345 --> 14:08.806
The freezer? What are you on about?

14:08.889 --> 14:10.724
I don't know the details.

14:11.809 --> 14:14.895
Anyway, there was a visitor too.
I'm too scared to do this anymore.

14:14.979 --> 14:16.897
Visitor? Did her family come to visit?

14:16.981 --> 14:19.942
No. Son Myeong-o.
He said he was her friend.

14:20.025 --> 14:20.943
Myeong-o?

14:22.862 --> 14:24.280
Why the hell did he show up?

14:27.283 --> 14:30.452
What on earth is going on right now?

14:36.959 --> 14:39.795
What did you do to Son Myeong-o?

14:41.797 --> 14:43.465
Did I actually hear that?

14:45.050 --> 14:46.594
This is killing me, damn it.

15:01.859 --> 15:04.528
Oh, it is you. Hello.

15:06.363 --> 15:08.532
Here for your retouching?
But it's not today.

15:08.616 --> 15:10.659
Oh, no. I was going to the grocery store.

15:12.912 --> 15:16.290
I'm sorry about what happened back then.
I was a little out of it.

15:17.416 --> 15:18.334
By the way,

15:19.293 --> 15:21.712
did I say anything weird that day?

15:27.593 --> 15:28.510
"Son Myeong-o"?

15:31.597 --> 15:33.182
You said that name several times.

15:36.143 --> 15:38.896
That can happen
as the anesthesia wears off.

15:38.979 --> 15:41.857
I think patients visit a place
between dream and fantasy.

15:42.691 --> 15:43.692
Oh, right.

15:44.568 --> 15:46.403
I had a really bad dream.

15:46.487 --> 15:48.530
That happens when you're really tired too.

15:48.614 --> 15:51.200
Take some vitamins.
I'll see you next time, then.

16:11.345 --> 16:14.431
You should eat dinner at home.
I'm going to make crab stew.

16:15.057 --> 16:16.976
I won't be there, so come and eat.

16:30.948 --> 16:32.199
Why are you eating salad?

16:33.158 --> 16:34.493
Didn't you see my text?

16:35.035 --> 16:35.869
I saw it.

16:36.954 --> 16:38.288
Why didn't you respond?

16:39.289 --> 16:40.499
I did, with silence.

16:49.466 --> 16:52.177
Do you play Go with Dong-eun?
What is this?

16:52.845 --> 16:54.596
What the hell are you two doing?

16:55.097 --> 16:57.016
I'm just curious, that's all.

16:57.516 --> 17:00.561
How could somebody like Dong-eun
even have your attention?

17:01.979 --> 17:03.939
When I first met her, it was curiosity.

17:04.898 --> 17:07.568
When she disappeared for a while,
I found myself waiting.

17:08.402 --> 17:10.821
And when we met again,
I wanted to beat her.

17:12.531 --> 17:14.700
But I lost the upper hand and floundered.

17:15.534 --> 17:16.869
I couldn't breathe.

17:18.370 --> 17:20.289
But I'd been wanting those moments.

17:21.623 --> 17:24.001
To feel like I can't breathe
during a Go match.

17:29.131 --> 17:31.050
That's called cheating.

17:33.552 --> 17:35.804
No matter how you phrase it,
that's cheating.

17:41.477 --> 17:44.772
It's unfair that you're the one saying it,
but I won't complain.

17:46.315 --> 17:48.984
That's why I don't ask
about you and Jeon Jae-jun.

17:55.032 --> 17:56.992
You're not coming to the airport, are you?

17:59.244 --> 18:00.287
Mom isn't, either?

18:05.417 --> 18:06.585
It's okay.

18:07.795 --> 18:09.213
I'll be fine by myself.

18:11.173 --> 18:12.007
Okay.

18:13.842 --> 18:18.514
Thank you for helping me run away
and giving me a new life, Ms. Moon.

18:19.181 --> 18:21.600
I'm not helping you run.
I'm giving you hope.

18:22.684 --> 18:23.602
Stay well.

18:26.814 --> 18:30.317
I'll go to art museums.
I swear I'll become a good person.

18:32.152 --> 18:33.487
Just like you,

18:34.154 --> 18:37.491
I'm going to become someone
who can change a person's life.

18:39.618 --> 18:40.869
That's a good dream.

18:43.497 --> 18:44.998
Don't become like me though.

18:46.959 --> 18:48.377
I'm not a good person.

18:58.595 --> 19:00.180
MYEONG-O

19:00.264 --> 19:04.434
OCTOBER 14
HEY, TAE-UK'S EX-WIFE! HOW MUCH LONGER?

19:08.480 --> 19:09.648
Are you in Russia?

19:09.731 --> 19:13.318
Hey, did Dong-eun play you too?

19:14.069 --> 19:16.488
Jeez, this is too much of a gamble.

19:17.239 --> 19:18.907
I need a hint or something.

19:22.786 --> 19:24.872
Oh, the tablet.

19:30.335 --> 19:31.253
Excuse me.

19:33.213 --> 19:35.382
There's a tablet
behind the passenger seat.

19:35.465 --> 19:36.550
Can you get it for me?

19:37.593 --> 19:38.510
Who are you?

19:38.594 --> 19:39.928
I'm Jae-jun's girlfriend.

19:40.012 --> 19:41.180
Oh, Mr. Jeon's…

19:42.806 --> 19:45.184
I know his girlfriends
because I've driven them,

19:45.267 --> 19:46.852
but I've never seen you before.

19:48.187 --> 19:50.147
Jae-jun is dating a redhead, isn't he?

19:50.230 --> 19:51.064
JUNEE

19:52.774 --> 19:55.611
Hey, it's me. You're on speaker right now.

19:55.694 --> 19:58.030
I left my tablet in your car.
I came to get it.

19:58.113 --> 19:59.865
-But your driver--
-Give it.

20:00.657 --> 20:02.910
You said the passenger seat, right?

20:10.709 --> 20:11.960
NEW RECORDING 1
FILE SAVED

20:13.253 --> 20:15.005
God, that dickhead.

20:16.673 --> 20:17.883
NEW RECORDING 1

20:17.966 --> 20:19.843
"October 19th"?

20:20.427 --> 20:22.262
What the hell did he do now?

20:25.849 --> 20:27.100
"Pommar… D"?

20:28.560 --> 20:29.394
What the hell?

20:32.397 --> 20:33.482
Hey.

20:35.234 --> 20:37.236
-What are you looking at?
-One minute.

20:37.945 --> 20:39.947
My patience… What is it?

20:40.030 --> 20:40.948
What is this?

20:48.288 --> 20:51.166
OCT 20 - SOLD MY CLOTHES ALREADY?
KNOW HOW MUCH THEY COST, MORON?

20:51.250 --> 20:53.210
OCT 21 - I'LL GIVE YOU COINS
COME GET IT

20:53.293 --> 20:54.711
OCT 23 - HEY
OCT 27 - HEY

20:54.795 --> 20:56.213
OCT 28 - FUCK, HEY

20:59.466 --> 21:01.051
We keep them for 30 days.

21:01.134 --> 21:04.263
But we don't have anything on
or before October 19th. I formatted it.

21:05.055 --> 21:06.473
You formatted it?

21:16.566 --> 21:18.568
I want to restore some CCTV footage.

21:19.444 --> 21:20.445
How long will it take?

21:21.029 --> 21:22.030
Seven to ten days.

21:22.114 --> 21:24.658
As you can see, I've got a lot to do.

21:25.158 --> 21:26.785
And that's fast turnaround.

21:27.828 --> 21:29.413
Can you do it faster?

21:29.496 --> 21:32.165
You see, I'm a really curious person.

21:32.916 --> 21:33.917
So I'm in a hurry.

21:34.001 --> 21:35.794
Well, you need to wait in line.

21:37.671 --> 21:40.090
Let's say that you just finished these.

21:42.467 --> 21:43.635
That'd be enough, right?

21:46.972 --> 21:49.057
We could say that I finished these too.

21:49.558 --> 21:50.434
Five days, then.

21:50.517 --> 21:52.269
Wow, you're good at your job.

21:54.730 --> 21:56.106
Three days, then.

22:02.571 --> 22:03.572
Three days?

22:17.836 --> 22:19.838
I gave the money to Lee Seok-jae.

22:19.921 --> 22:22.299
And I've recruited a few sharks as well.

22:22.883 --> 22:24.801
Here, take 20 first.

22:24.885 --> 22:26.678
But are you sure he has a daughter?

22:27.179 --> 22:29.598
I haven't seen the kid.
She's not even at school.

22:30.515 --> 22:32.726
Just keep watching him.
I'll call you again.

22:40.067 --> 22:44.154
SEMYEONG MIDDLE SCHOOL

22:49.076 --> 22:51.078
Hello. Is this Semyeong Middle School?

22:52.954 --> 22:55.374
I delivered the package.

22:56.166 --> 22:57.000
How was she?

22:59.127 --> 23:00.295
She was a mess.

23:01.838 --> 23:04.758
Still, she smiled
when she heard your name.

23:18.313 --> 23:22.150
Ms. Kang's daughter is leaving
the country tomorrow, right?

23:28.949 --> 23:30.700
Speaking of, Seong-hee,

23:31.201 --> 23:34.955
do you still talk to those guys
with the gangster tattoos?

23:36.331 --> 23:37.916
I need their help.

23:38.583 --> 23:39.960
Would that be possible?

24:11.700 --> 24:13.034
What are you glowering at?

24:14.161 --> 24:15.662
Just keep walking.

24:17.831 --> 24:21.334
Jeez, Jjong. Look at these guys
messing with you in broad daylight.

24:41.563 --> 24:42.564
MS. MOON

24:43.064 --> 24:44.149
Head to the airport.

24:45.150 --> 24:46.985
Sun-a's flight leaves at three.

24:47.486 --> 24:49.488
Don't worry about being followed.

25:06.922 --> 25:08.423
You didn't learn your lesson.

25:13.261 --> 25:14.429
Going somewhere again?

25:16.806 --> 25:18.308
I'm going grocery shopping.

25:19.226 --> 25:20.393
But I can go later.

25:22.646 --> 25:23.647
Please come in.

25:28.026 --> 25:29.945
Trying to go off the grid again?

25:31.530 --> 25:34.449
I told you, I was going grocery shopping.

25:35.242 --> 25:37.077
You've got guts. That's good.

25:37.744 --> 25:41.164
Why are you checking the time?
You're making your guest feel bad.

25:41.831 --> 25:43.583
Do you have a plane to catch?

25:45.335 --> 25:47.170
Tell me what you're here for, ma'am.

25:47.754 --> 25:50.257
What do you want me to do?
What should I do?

25:50.340 --> 25:51.424
I don't see any bags.

25:53.051 --> 25:56.638
Oh, so you're not the one
who bought the ticket.

25:57.222 --> 25:59.057
It's your daughter, isn't it?

25:59.724 --> 26:01.726
You even made her
drop out of school, right?

26:02.561 --> 26:05.564
No. She's not going anywhere.
We can't afford that.

26:06.523 --> 26:08.441
Please just tell me why you're here.

26:08.525 --> 26:11.736
Where's your daughter?
Answer me. That's why I'm here.

26:15.782 --> 26:17.951
Is it today? She's leaving today?

26:18.034 --> 26:20.620
No, ma'am. That's not true!

26:21.663 --> 26:22.914
It is today.

26:23.665 --> 26:25.667
Well, then that pisses me off.

26:26.334 --> 26:29.254
So you weren't bluffing.
You really weren't scared of me.

26:29.754 --> 26:33.258
You're going to your daughter right now
with that fake bag of yours?

26:34.426 --> 26:36.094
You're not going anywhere today.

26:36.636 --> 26:38.972
You already know
Hye-jeong's a flight attendant.

26:40.015 --> 26:41.516
Want me to find your daughter?

26:42.267 --> 26:44.603
I won't go, ma'am. I won't!

26:45.186 --> 26:47.731
I'll give my all
to the jobs you give me, I swear!

26:47.814 --> 26:49.316
Just tell me anything, ma'am.

26:54.446 --> 26:56.698
All right, do as I say.
And give it your all.

26:57.574 --> 27:01.077
Does Dong-eun have
another helper like you?

27:07.876 --> 27:08.877
There's…

27:10.003 --> 27:10.920
a man.

27:12.213 --> 27:13.131
A man?

27:14.382 --> 27:16.051
Dong-eun has a guy?

27:16.676 --> 27:17.844
What the hell does he do?

27:18.553 --> 27:19.971
I'm not too sure about…

27:20.889 --> 27:24.392
I'll look into it. I'll find out
all about him and call you, ma'am!

27:24.476 --> 27:27.187
Try anything funny,
and I'll drag your daughter back here.

27:27.270 --> 27:29.564
I won't, ma'am. I swear!

27:31.650 --> 27:33.485
I guess I'll have to trust you, huh?

27:35.070 --> 27:36.488
Oh, and one more thing.

27:36.988 --> 27:39.783
I want you to keep doing
what you've been doing.

27:40.492 --> 27:44.579
Jae-jun, Sa-ra, and Hye-jeong.
Start tailing them again.

27:45.413 --> 27:48.166
Find out who's meeting who,
where, and when.

27:49.042 --> 27:50.043
Understand?

27:52.504 --> 27:53.755
Yes, ma'am.

27:55.507 --> 27:56.675
See you next time.

28:02.013 --> 28:05.183
Oh, your husband hasn't been
coming home recently, has he?

28:07.102 --> 28:09.437
I've been giving him money
so he can gamble.

28:10.522 --> 28:12.357
But I won't give him any more today.

28:13.608 --> 28:15.193
He'll be coming home early.

28:17.570 --> 28:20.949
That's the least punishment you deserve.

28:35.880 --> 28:38.133
-The hospital director's son?
-Yeah!

28:38.967 --> 28:41.720
He's been sniffing around.
What are you going to do?

28:42.303 --> 28:43.805
You told me not to worry.

28:44.639 --> 28:46.558
You told me she'd turn into black muck

28:46.641 --> 28:49.269
after rotting in the mortuary
for 18 years.

28:49.352 --> 28:50.979
But apparently, she's frozen.

28:52.397 --> 28:56.276
-What if they perform an autopsy on her?
-Frozen? What does that mean?

28:56.359 --> 28:58.278
You shouldn't be asking me that.

28:59.237 --> 29:01.239
You're supposed to know what it means!

29:02.323 --> 29:06.161
You're the one who couldn't take care
of a corpse and caused this whole mess!

29:07.287 --> 29:08.621
Are you sure it's frozen?

29:09.122 --> 29:12.041
Isn't that illegal?
What the hell are they playing at?

29:20.675 --> 29:21.760
Hello, sir.

29:21.843 --> 29:23.094
-Oh, hey.
-Yes, sir.

29:23.595 --> 29:27.348
Which department oversees the storage
of bodies at general hospitals?

29:27.849 --> 29:29.434
What kind of bodies, sir?

29:29.517 --> 29:32.187
A bereaved family kept a body there
for over a decade.

29:32.270 --> 29:33.897
But the hospital froze it.

29:33.980 --> 29:36.316
I want to know
what the law says about that.

29:36.399 --> 29:38.777
I mean, isn't that illegal?

29:38.860 --> 29:39.944
More than a decade?

29:41.696 --> 29:45.533
I think the Ministry of Health and Welfare
or the district office would handle that.

29:45.617 --> 29:46.618
I'll look into it.

29:46.701 --> 29:49.662
I want to find some faults with it.
Can you make that happen?

29:50.246 --> 29:52.916
Oh. Yes, sir. I'll look into it.

29:59.380 --> 30:02.050
Sun-a, what are you doing?
It's time to go in.

30:02.133 --> 30:04.052
Please wait. Just five more minutes.

30:07.972 --> 30:09.474
To Ms. Laura.

30:10.642 --> 30:11.684
Hello.

30:11.768 --> 30:13.269
Damn it!

30:13.353 --> 30:17.857
I'm the mother of Lee Sun-a,
who should have arrived with this letter.

30:20.235 --> 30:21.486
You damned bitch.

30:23.780 --> 30:25.532
Man, you fucking bitch.

30:29.869 --> 30:31.204
This is nothing, shit.

30:32.789 --> 30:35.875
You fucking bitch.
Why the fuck did you quit your job, huh?

30:35.959 --> 30:36.793
Hey.

30:37.669 --> 30:40.338
You're up to something, aren't you? Huh?

30:40.839 --> 30:44.175
Fucking bitch.
Where the hell did you hide Sun-a?

30:44.259 --> 30:47.262
Where did you hide her? Where? Damn it!

30:50.098 --> 30:53.518
Sun-a was the only joy

30:54.686 --> 30:56.896
in my unfortunate life.

31:01.526 --> 31:03.903
I won't ask you for much.

31:05.864 --> 31:08.700
Sun-a doesn't have any allergies,
and she's healthy.

31:09.617 --> 31:12.036
So please let her try all kinds of foods.

31:15.748 --> 31:19.419
I'm sending my joy to you.

31:21.588 --> 31:22.672
So please…

31:24.090 --> 31:25.425
give her love.

31:27.886 --> 31:29.053
Please.

31:32.724 --> 31:34.058
Fucking hell.

31:34.142 --> 31:36.895
You hid her at some asshole's place,
didn't you?

31:36.978 --> 31:40.315
Who is he? Who the hell is he?
Fucking bitch!

31:40.398 --> 31:43.860
Answer me! Fucking answer me!

31:49.073 --> 31:50.158
No matter…

31:52.243 --> 31:54.162
how much you break me…

31:55.955 --> 31:58.958
I'm not scared of you anymore.

32:01.085 --> 32:02.003
I…

32:02.921 --> 32:04.923
I'm going to put on red lipstick.

32:06.299 --> 32:08.801
I'm going to wear a leather jacket too.

32:09.636 --> 32:13.806
You're still giving me bullshit.
I guess you need more beating, huh?

32:13.890 --> 32:16.559
Shit! Goddamn it!

32:18.770 --> 32:19.771
And…

32:22.273 --> 32:25.526
I'm going to go to a country far,
far away,

32:26.861 --> 32:28.947
and drive along the road on and on.

32:31.908 --> 32:34.077
Do whatever the fuck you want.

32:35.620 --> 32:37.997
It's your funeral today, okay?

32:38.081 --> 32:41.250
I said, today is your funeral!

33:24.502 --> 33:26.087
MOM

33:31.843 --> 33:33.636
MOM
I'M OUT OF RICE BRANG ME MONEY

33:41.561 --> 33:43.730
Close your eyes,
put your head on the table.

33:45.189 --> 33:47.025
This sound helped me a lot.

33:48.192 --> 33:50.069
It brings me a short moment of peace.

33:58.786 --> 34:00.371
So that's what those were for.

34:01.873 --> 34:03.750
It was something good for your mind.

34:25.396 --> 34:27.148
Close your eyes.

35:08.272 --> 35:09.982
PARENTS - EMERGENCY CONTACT LIST

35:11.818 --> 35:13.736
What if she actually picks up?

35:14.237 --> 35:17.240
She'll never pick up, okay? Don't worry.

35:17.323 --> 35:20.159
We have to keep calling her
so she doesn't come here.

35:21.369 --> 35:23.454
I'll keep trying, then, ma'am!

35:24.580 --> 35:25.498
You've got a call.

35:26.791 --> 35:29.460
Jeez, the bitch is finally calling me!

35:29.544 --> 35:31.420
She's the first person I texted.

35:35.716 --> 35:37.802
Hello, is this Seung-a's mother?

35:38.928 --> 35:41.347
Right. I'll tell you the time.

35:43.474 --> 35:46.477
Seung-a must have gotten
her pretty face from you.

35:47.228 --> 35:50.982
She's the classroom president, right?
My God.

35:51.899 --> 35:54.402
You must be so proud of her.

35:55.570 --> 35:56.571
Yes.

35:56.654 --> 35:59.407
But why did you want to see me?

36:00.408 --> 36:04.537
I'm Moon Dong-eun's mother.

36:05.371 --> 36:06.539
So?

36:07.582 --> 36:09.792
I'm the mother
of Seung-a's homeroom teacher.

36:09.876 --> 36:13.129
I mean, didn't the other moms tell you?

36:15.506 --> 36:16.340
You're crazy.

36:17.091 --> 36:17.925
What?

36:19.093 --> 36:21.179
Your remaining payment has been paid.

36:23.514 --> 36:26.184
The registration will be available
in about a week.

36:26.767 --> 36:27.602
Here.

36:29.520 --> 36:33.191
Excuse me, but why do you want to buy
a funeral home that's closed down?

36:33.274 --> 36:35.026
Is it going to be developed?

36:36.027 --> 36:40.281
If you want chocolate, you need to buy
a box of chocolate first, right?

36:40.990 --> 36:41.908
It's like that.

36:43.284 --> 36:44.535
Oh, I see.

36:46.120 --> 36:48.289
It's been on the market for a long time.

36:48.372 --> 36:50.791
-You bought it for a good price.
-Thank you.

37:13.439 --> 37:16.359
Mom, I got here safely.

37:17.818 --> 37:20.404
I thought you might have my phone.

37:21.322 --> 37:23.658
I waited for a really long time
at the airport.

37:24.408 --> 37:28.246
I'm sad that I didn't get to see you,
but I'll just wait for you here

37:28.746 --> 37:30.581
because you'll be coming soon.

37:30.665 --> 37:31.749
I love you, Mom.

37:34.585 --> 37:36.921
Mom, I love you so much.

38:12.498 --> 38:14.750
MS. MOON

38:15.501 --> 38:16.627
POWER OFF

38:31.475 --> 38:35.896
This device is switched off.
Please leave a message after the beep.

38:35.980 --> 38:38.357
MS. KANG

38:59.754 --> 39:00.755
Damn it.

39:24.695 --> 39:25.696
Damn it!

39:30.826 --> 39:31.827
Go over there.

39:38.084 --> 39:40.753
I knew it. You fucking bitch! Come here.

39:40.836 --> 39:42.797
Come here. Fucking hell!

39:43.881 --> 39:44.965
You bitch.

39:46.634 --> 39:48.552
What's this? Where did you get this?

39:49.053 --> 39:50.388
You said you didn't have any!

39:50.471 --> 39:53.432
It's not my money. I have to give it back.

39:53.516 --> 39:55.434
Don't give me that nonsense!

39:57.311 --> 39:59.730
Sun-a's working somewhere, isn't she?
Which bar is it?

40:00.648 --> 40:03.984
Damn it, you should've asked
for more than this, you idiot!

40:04.068 --> 40:06.320
Sun-a's only 14 years old.

40:07.029 --> 40:08.614
-How could you even think--
-Shit!

40:09.615 --> 40:11.700
So, where'd you get it,
you fucking bitch?

40:13.494 --> 40:14.995
Some woman

40:15.996 --> 40:19.750
asked me to send somebody a text
with my phone.

40:20.459 --> 40:22.586
The other person knew her number already.

40:23.379 --> 40:25.965
She said she wanted to scare that person.

40:26.549 --> 40:29.802
But the content of the text
just seemed so weird to me.

40:30.428 --> 40:31.595
I'm not lying.

40:32.346 --> 40:33.431
How is it weird?

40:34.014 --> 40:37.101
I'm going to just give this back.

40:37.184 --> 40:38.352
Please, Seok-jae!

40:38.436 --> 40:40.438
Just answer my fucking question!

40:41.439 --> 40:42.773
What text was it?

40:44.066 --> 40:45.317
Where's your phone?

40:48.404 --> 40:49.989
SEVEN MISSED CALLS
MA'AM

40:52.825 --> 40:54.201
I JUST NEED YOU TO SEND A TEXT

40:54.285 --> 40:55.119
I WON'T DO IT

40:55.202 --> 40:56.620
THINK ABOUT IT, IT'S GOOD MONEY

41:09.049 --> 41:11.469
So, this is what you've been doing, huh?

41:26.150 --> 41:26.984
Kim.

41:28.235 --> 41:30.988
Gyeong-ran.

41:32.364 --> 41:33.199
Huh?

41:36.076 --> 41:37.495
Your name also has an O.

41:38.746 --> 41:39.580
An O?

41:40.748 --> 41:41.916
The shaman told you

41:42.666 --> 41:46.045
to avoid people with O's in their names
because they'd bring you bad luck.

41:46.128 --> 41:46.962
HA DO-YEONG

41:48.005 --> 41:49.089
Son Myeong-o.

41:50.841 --> 41:53.010
-Ms. Park, we're shooting.
-Okay.

41:55.804 --> 41:57.181
A nice color too, right?

41:57.264 --> 41:58.933
-It's so well made!
-I like this.

41:59.016 --> 42:00.017
-Oh my.
-This one.

42:00.100 --> 42:03.521
Wow, it's so amazing. My goodness!

42:05.731 --> 42:06.649
Oh my.

42:07.191 --> 42:10.319
Oh my God! Look at this one!

42:10.402 --> 42:12.488
I KNOW THAT YOUR DAUGHTER KILLED SOMEBODY

42:23.415 --> 42:24.416
What's wrong?

42:24.917 --> 42:26.168
Yeong-ae!

42:27.044 --> 42:29.380
Hong Yeong-ae! Wait up, Yeong-ae!

42:30.381 --> 42:31.549
Hong Yeong-ae!

42:33.175 --> 42:34.426
Yeong-ae!

42:35.135 --> 42:36.220
Yeong-ae!

42:37.888 --> 42:39.557
Stop, Yeong-ae!

42:41.892 --> 42:42.851
Hong Yeong-ae!

42:56.073 --> 42:57.491
Do you remember, Yeon-jin?

42:58.951 --> 43:02.621
Some time ago,
you said to watch out for swells.

43:03.706 --> 43:06.333
Swells will be flowing
into the East Sea for some time,

43:06.417 --> 43:09.962
and high waves will be going over
some seashore rocks and breakwaters.

43:10.045 --> 43:11.797
A swell may be a receding wave,

43:11.880 --> 43:15.009
but it can become the biggest
and the most ferocious wave in the sea.

43:17.261 --> 43:19.179
You said a swell can be scary

43:20.931 --> 43:25.436
because no accurate forecasting method
has been developed to predict one.

43:26.937 --> 43:29.189
And it consumes everything in an instant,

43:29.940 --> 43:33.694
even if the sea was calm
without any ripples before it occurred.

43:53.547 --> 43:55.716
That day, Ms. Kang saw her face

43:57.301 --> 43:58.969
as she had never seen it before.

44:00.054 --> 44:03.307
She could see hope
on her own unfamiliar face.

44:05.643 --> 44:08.729
But I don't think she was the only one

44:09.521 --> 44:11.023
who found hope that day.

44:14.818 --> 44:16.987
FORENSIC DATA RECOVERY

44:35.923 --> 44:36.924
Auntie, how do I look?

44:37.841 --> 44:40.427
Auntie, this is green, right?

44:41.845 --> 44:43.514
There's some red in it.

44:44.139 --> 44:45.224
Where?

45:07.788 --> 45:08.622
Here.

45:13.877 --> 45:15.879
Is a cop allowed to do this, Yeong-jun?

45:17.423 --> 45:18.507
What do you think?

45:19.341 --> 45:22.511
If cops were all righteous
and had a sense of duty,

45:22.594 --> 45:24.012
why would we need the law?

45:24.638 --> 45:27.808
My ambition is growing,
but I think I'm out of luck.

45:29.977 --> 45:31.395
So keep a close eye on it.

45:32.229 --> 45:33.897
That guy's my retirement pension.

45:36.233 --> 45:37.901
Don't worry, Yeong-jun!

45:49.705 --> 45:50.706
Still feel sick?

45:54.168 --> 45:55.919
Maybe I drove too aggressively.

46:00.174 --> 46:01.592
I have a question.

46:04.344 --> 46:08.265
In the beginning, before you even saw
the pictures at my apartment,

46:08.766 --> 46:12.352
you already knew who Myeong-o was.

46:13.979 --> 46:15.606
Why didn't you tell me about it?

46:16.106 --> 46:17.816
Why didn't you ask me anything?

46:18.442 --> 46:19.902
Because I might have killed him?

46:25.365 --> 46:29.036
A headsman doesn't question
a royal command.

46:30.162 --> 46:31.997
It's all the same to me.

46:32.998 --> 46:36.251
I don't care
whether you killed him or not.

46:37.795 --> 46:40.464
I'll just give you whatever you ask for,

46:41.548 --> 46:44.051
whether it be a corpse
or destroying evidence.

46:47.012 --> 46:48.680
Why do you trust me blindly?

46:48.764 --> 46:51.433
Why would you do anything for me?
What makes you so sure?

46:51.517 --> 46:53.894
What I'm feeling is much more than that.

46:55.813 --> 46:57.231
I've told you before.

46:58.482 --> 47:00.609
That I had a very rough season in my life.

47:02.861 --> 47:04.696
I realized while I was tutoring you.

47:05.239 --> 47:07.658
"Oh, this woman

47:08.492 --> 47:09.660
is my salvation."

47:15.666 --> 47:19.753
At some point, one needs to choose
what kind of person they'll become.

47:20.921 --> 47:24.508
Well, I've chosen
to become your partner in crime.

47:25.926 --> 47:27.177
It suits me too.

47:31.890 --> 47:33.642
Don't people say you're insane?

47:33.725 --> 47:35.602
I'm planning on living like a madman.

47:37.354 --> 47:38.438
Let me be.

47:45.320 --> 47:50.075
I wonder which one of us will cause
a swell with our hope, Yeon-jin.

48:31.700 --> 48:32.993
YEONGSAN FUNERAL HOME

48:33.076 --> 48:34.745
Oh, hello there!

50:46.793 --> 50:51.798
Subtitle translation by: Daham Yoon
